    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Four-Bedroom Bungalow on C.1 Acre\r\nPhoenix Estates are delighted to present to the market this attractive four-bedroom detached bungalow, situated on a generous C.1-acre site with a detached garage. Ideally located just off the main Enniscorthy–Clonroche road, the property is within easy reach of Clonroche village and all its amenities, as well as a range of local sports clubs and recreational facilities. The property offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout, comprising an entrance hall, large living room, spacious kitchen/diner, utility room, four bedrooms, main bathroom and ensuite. Outside, the generous site offers excellent space and privacy, making this an ideal family home in a convenient and sought-after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nHall: 4.32 x 2.3 – wooden floor, coving, space for cloakroom, archway to inner hall.\r\n \r\nLiving room: 4.77 x 4.54 – wooden floor, solid fuel stove, coving, 2 windows\r\n \r\nKitchen: 7.4 x 4.2 tiled floor, fitted kitchen eye and waist level units, tiled splash back, coving, oven hob, dishwasher. \r\n \r\nUtility: 1.6 x 2.3 – tiled floor, back door, plumbed for washing machine, space for dryer. \r\n \r\nInner Hall: 9.4 x 1.06 – wooden floor, hot press\r\n \r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.8 x 3.5 – wooden floor\r\n \r\nEnsuite: 2.9 x 1 tiled floor and walls, W.C. WHB, free standing shower.\r\n \r\nBedroom 2: 3.55 x 2.9\t- wooden floor \r\n \r\nBedroom 3: 3.4 x 3 – wooden floor\r\n \r\nBedroom 4: 3.4 x 3 – wooden floor \r\n \r\nBathroom: 2.9 x 2 tiled floor and walls, shower off taps, bath, W.C, WHB \r\n \r\nGarage: 5.8 x 3.5 open plan"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tConvenient location within easy reach of Clonroche village \r\n•\tEasy access to the Enniscorthy - Clonroche road \r\n•\tClose to local schools, sports clubs and recreational facilities \r\n•\tGenerous C.1-acre site \r\n•\tDetached garage \r\n•\tGood standard of finish throughout \r\n•\tLarge rear garden \r\n•\tBright and spacious accommodation"
      },
